"gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:7","translation":"Nay! Truly, the Record (writing of the deeds) of the Fujjâr (disbelievers, polytheists, sinners, evil-doers and the wicked) is (preserved) in Sijjîn.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:7:1","position":1,"arabic":"كَلَّآ","kind":"word","gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"kallā","lemma":"كَلَّا","root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"83:7:2","position":2,"arabic":"إِنَّ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"83:7:3","position":3,"arabic":"كِتَـٰبَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(the) record","transliteration":"kitāba","lemma":"كِتَٰب","root":"كتب","entryId":"l-a68c915be321aa35"},{"key":"83:7:4","position":4,"arabic":"ٱلْفُجَّارِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) the wicked","transliteration":"l-fujāri","lemma":"فُجَّار","root":"فجر","entryId":null},{"key":"83:7:5","position":5,"arabic":"لَفِى","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) surely in","transliteration":"lafī","lemma":"فِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-f0418efd4241a27e"},{"key":"83:7:6","position":6,"arabic":"سِجِّينٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"Sijjin","transliteration":"sijjīnin","lemma":"سِجِّين","root":"سجن","entryId":null},{"key":"83:7:7","position":7,"arabic":"٧","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:8","translation":"And what will make you know what Sijjîn is?","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:8:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَمَآ","kind":"word","gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"83:8:2","position":2,"arabic":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","kind":"word","gloss":"can make you know","transliteration":"adrāka","lemma":"أَدْرَىٰ","root":"دري","entryId":null},{"key":"83:8:3","position":3,"arabic":"مَا","kind":"word","gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"83:8:4","position":4,"arabic":"سِجِّينٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) Sijjin","transliteration":"sijjīnun","lemma":"سِجِّين","root":"سجن","entryId":null},{"key":"83:8:5","position":5,"arabic":"٨","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:9","translation":"A Register inscribed.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:9:1","position":1,"arabic":"كِتَـٰبٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"A book","transliteration":"kitābun","lemma":"كِتَٰب","root":"كتب","entryId":"l-a68c915be321aa35"},{"key":"83:9:2","position":2,"arabic":"مَّرْقُومٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"written","transliteration":"marqūmun","lemma":"مَّرْقُوم","root":"رقم","entryId":null},{"key":"83:9:3","position":3,"arabic":"٩","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:10","translation":"Woe, that Day, to those who deny.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:10:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَيْلٌۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"Woe","transliteration":"waylun","lemma":"وَيْل","root":null,"entryId":"l-d11f2adf827dd758"},{"key":"83:10:2","position":2,"arabic":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"that Day","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ","root":"يوم","entryId":"l-675d35e3d4bddca4"},{"key":"83:10:3","position":3,"arabic":"لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"to the deniers","transliteration":"lil'mukadhibīna","lemma":"مُّكَذِّبِين","root":"كذب","entryId":null},{"key":"83:10:4","position":4,"arabic":"١٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:11","translation":"Those who deny the Day of Recompense.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:11:1","position":1,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"83:11:2","position":2,"arabic":"يُكَذِّبُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"deny","transliteration":"yukadhibūna","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","root":"كذب","entryId":"l-db86b0654d661fb2"},{"key":"83:11:3","position":3,"arabic":"بِيَوْمِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(the) Day","transliteration":"biyawmi","lemma":"يَوْم","root":"يوم","entryId":"l-bd6f5747b4dfe79c"},{"key":"83:11:4","position":4,"arabic":"ٱلدِّينِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) the Judgment","transliteration":"l-dīni","lemma":"دِين","root":"دين","entryId":"l-869ef1d12b24f52a"},{"key":"83:11:5","position":5,"arabic":"١١","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:12","translation":"And none can deny it except every transgressor beyond bounds, (in disbelief, oppression and disobedience to Allâh) the sinner!","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:12:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَمَا","kind":"word","gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"83:12:2","position":2,"arabic":"يُكَذِّبُ","kind":"word","gloss":"can deny","transliteration":"yukadhibu","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","root":"كذب","entryId":"l-db86b0654d661fb2"},{"key":"83:12:3","position":3,"arabic":"بِهِۦٓ","kind":"word","gloss":"[of] it","transliteration":"bihi","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"83:12:4","position":4,"arabic":"إِلَّا","kind":"word","gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","lemma":"إِلَّا","root":null,"entryId":"l-250ca4d5b58814dd"},{"key":"83:12:5","position":5,"arabic":"كُلُّ","kind":"word","gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","lemma":"كُلّ","root":"كلل","entryId":"l-6fac43bd71e38426"},{"key":"83:12:6","position":6,"arabic":"مُعْتَدٍ","kind":"word","gloss":"transgressor","transliteration":"muʿ'tadin","lemma":"مُعْتَد","root":"عدو","entryId":null},{"key":"83:12:7","position":7,"arabic":"أَثِيمٍ","kind":"word","gloss":"sinful","transliteration":"athīmin","lemma":"أَثِيم","root":"اثم","entryId":null},{"key":"83:12:8","position":8,"arabic":"١٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:13","translation":"When Our Verses (of the Qur’ân) are recited to him he says: \"Tales of the ancients!\"","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:13:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِذَا","kind":"word","gloss":"When","transliteration":"idhā","lemma":"إِذَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-d00a4141bad00037"},{"key":"83:13:2","position":2,"arabic":"تُتْلَىٰ","kind":"word","gloss":"are recited","transliteration":"tut'lā","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","root":"تلو","entryId":"l-a044b106004ffdee"},{"key":"83:13:3","position":3,"arabic":"عَلَيْهِ","kind":"word","gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","lemma":"عَلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-08dd9283adb70e54"},{"key":"83:13:4","position":4,"arabic":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","kind":"word","gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"āyātunā","lemma":"ءَايَة","root":"ايي","entryId":"l-5ab33552830ad5b5"},{"key":"83:13:5","position":5,"arabic":"قَالَ","kind":"word","gloss":"he says","transliteration":"qāla","lemma":"قَالَ","root":"قول","entryId":"l-effaf24a5c86c56f"},{"key":"83:13:6","position":6,"arabic":"أَسَـٰطِيرُ","kind":"word","gloss":"Stories","transliteration":"asāṭīru","lemma":"أَسَٰطِير","root":"سطر","entryId":null},{"key":"83:13:7","position":7,"arabic":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) the former (people)","transliteration":"l-awalīna","lemma":"أَوَّل","root":"اول","entryId":"l-ecdf865520009f7c"},{"key":"83:13:8","position":8,"arabic":"١٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:14","translation":"Nay! But on their hearts is the Rân (covering of sins and evil deeds) which they used to earn.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"Narrated Abu Hurairah رضي الله عنه: Allâh’s Messenger صلى الله عليه وسلم said, \"When a slave (a person) commits a sin (an evil deed) a black dot is dotted on his heart. Then if that person gives up that evil deed (sin), begs Allâh to forgive him, and repents, then his heart is cleared (from that heart covering dot); but if he repeats the evil deed (sin), then that covering is increased till his heart is completely covered with it. And that is Ar-Rân which Allâh mentioned (in the Qur’ân), \"Nay! but on their hearts is the Rân (covering of sins and evil deeds) which they used to earn.\" (At-Tirmidhi, Vol.5, Hadith No.3334).","ref":null}],"tokens":[{"key":"83:14:1","position":1,"arabic":"كَلَّا ۖ","kind":"word","gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"kallā","lemma":"كَلَّا","root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"83:14:2","position":2,"arabic":"بَلْ ۜ","kind":"word","gloss":"But","transliteration":"bal","lemma":"بَل","root":null,"entryId":"l-706f9c6eca0445cc"},{"key":"83:14:3","position":3,"arabic":"رَانَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(the) stain has covered","transliteration":"rāna","lemma":"رَانَ","root":"رين","entryId":null},{"key":"83:14:4","position":4,"arabic":"عَلَىٰ","kind":"word","gloss":"[over]","transliteration":"ʿalā","lemma":"عَلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-08dd9283adb70e54"},{"key":"83:14:5","position":5,"arabic":"قُلُوبِهِم","kind":"word","gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","lemma":"قَلْب","root":"قلب","entryId":"l-4fe27e415bdd53be"},{"key":"83:14:6","position":6,"arabic":"مَّا","kind":"word","gloss":"(for) what","transliteration":"mā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"83:14:7","position":7,"arabic":"كَانُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","lemma":"كَانَ","root":"كون","entryId":"l-4b2f9969a9af0d45"},{"key":"83:14:8","position":8,"arabic":"يَكْسِبُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"earn","transliteration":"yaksibūna","lemma":"كَسَبَ","root":"كسب","entryId":"l-aaca8d302e23314c"},{"key":"83:14:9","position":9,"arabic":"١٤","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:15","translation":"Nay! Surely they (evil-doers) will be veiled from seeing their Lord that Day.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:15:1","position":1,"arabic":"كَلَّآ","kind":"word","gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"kallā","lemma":"كَلَّا","root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"83:15:2","position":2,"arabic":"إِنَّهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"83:15:3","position":3,"arabic":"عَن","kind":"word","gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","lemma":"عَن","root":null,"entryId":"l-f1109a78c8548754"},{"key":"83:15:4","position":4,"arabic":"رَّبِّهِمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","lemma":"رَبّ","root":"ربب","entryId":"l-a0ed3c982709a296"},{"key":"83:15:5","position":5,"arabic":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","kind":"word","gloss":"that Day","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ","root":"يوم","entryId":"l-675d35e3d4bddca4"},{"key":"83:15:6","position":6,"arabic":"لَّمَحْجُوبُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"surely will be partitioned","transliteration":"lamaḥjūbūna","lemma":"مَحْجُوبُون","root":"حجب","entryId":null},{"key":"83:15:7","position":7,"arabic":"١٥","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:16","translation":"Then, verily, they will indeed enter (and taste) the burning flame of Hell.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:16:1","position":1,"arabic":"ثُمَّ","kind":"word","gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","lemma":"ثُمّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-75b66396af12da75"},{"key":"83:16:2","position":2,"arabic":"إِنَّهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"83:16:3","position":3,"arabic":"لَصَالُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"(surely) will burn","transliteration":