"translation":"And, whenever they passed by them, used to wink one to another (in mockery).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:30:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَإِذَا","kind":"word","gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","lemma":"إِذَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-d00a4141bad00037"},{"key":"83:30:2","position":2,"arabic":"مَرُّوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they passed","transliteration":"marrū","lemma":"مَرَّ","root":"مرر","entryId":null},{"key":"83:30:3","position":3,"arabic":"بِهِمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"by them","transliteration":"bihim","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"83:30:4","position":4,"arabic":"يَتَغَامَزُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"they winked at one another","transliteration":"yataghāmazūna","lemma":"يَتَغَامَزُ","root":"غمز","entryId":null},{"key":"83:30:5","position":5,"arabic":"٣٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:31","translation":"And when they returned to their own people, they would return jesting;","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:31:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَإِذَا","kind":"word","gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","lemma":"إِذَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-d00a4141bad00037"},{"key":"83:31:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱنقَلَبُوٓا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they returned","transliteration":"inqalabū","lemma":"انقَلَبَ","root":"قلب","entryId":null},{"key":"83:31:3","position":3,"arabic":"إِلَىٰٓ","kind":"word","gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","lemma":"إِلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-53539d2c3606b99e"},{"key":"83:31:4","position":4,"arabic":"أَهْلِهِمُ","kind":"word","gloss":"their people","transliteration":"ahlihimu","lemma":"أَهْل","root":"اهل","entryId":"l-5fd11f4d420d23ca"},{"key":"83:31:5","position":5,"arabic":"ٱنقَلَبُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they would return","transliteration":"inqalabū","lemma":"انقَلَبَ","root":"قلب","entryId":null},{"key":"83:31:6","position":6,"arabic":"فَكِهِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"jesting","transliteration":"fakihīna","lemma":"فَكِهِين","root":"فكه","entryId":null},{"key":"83:31:7","position":7,"arabic":"٣١","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:32","translation":"And when they saw them, they said: \"Verily these have indeed gone astray!\"","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:32:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَإِذَا","kind":"word","gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","lemma":"إِذَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-d00a4141bad00037"},{"key":"83:32:2","position":2,"arabic":"رَأَوْهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"they saw them","transliteration":"ra-awhum","lemma":"رَءَا","root":"راي","entryId":"l-6b7f279dfcd3ea58"},{"key":"83:32:3","position":3,"arabic":"قَالُوٓا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","lemma":"قَالَ","root":"قول","entryId":"l-effaf24a5c86c56f"},{"key":"83:32:4","position":4,"arabic":"إِنَّ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"83:32:5","position":5,"arabic":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","kind":"word","gloss":"these","transliteration":"hāulāi","lemma":"هَٰذَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-a874a3c6f146e6a2"},{"key":"83:32:6","position":6,"arabic":"لَضَآلُّونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"surely have gone astray","transliteration":"laḍāllūna","lemma":"ضَآلّ","root":"ضلل","entryId":null},{"key":"83:32:7","position":7,"arabic":"٣٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:33","translation":"But they (disbelievers, sinners) had not been sent as watchers over them (the believers).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"83:33:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَمَآ","kind":"word","gloss":"But not","transliteration":"wamā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"83:33:2","position":2,"arabic":"أُرْسِلُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they had been sent","transliteration":"ur'silū","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","root":"رسل","entryId":"l-8b46fe6c57f84b97"},{"key":"83:33:3","position":3,"arabic":"عَلَيْهِمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","lemma":"عَلَىٰ","root":null,"entryId":"l-08dd9283adb70e54"},{"key":"83:33:4","position":4,"arabic":"حَـٰفِظِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(as) guardians","transliteration":"ḥāfiẓīna","lemma":"حَٰفِظ","root":"حفظ","entryId":null},{"key":"83:33:5","position":5,"arabic":"٣٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"83:34","translation":"But this Day (the Day of Resurrection) those who believe will laugh at the disbelievers","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"Narrated Anas bin Mâlik رضي الله عنه: A man said, \"O Allâh’s Prophet! Will Allâh gather a disbeliever (prone) on his face on the Day of Resurrection?\" He صلى الله عليه وسلم said, \"Will not the One Who made him walk on his feet in this world, be able to make him walk on his face on the Day of Resurrection?\" (Qatâdah, a subnarrator, said: \"Yes, By the Power of Our Lord!\") (Sahih Al-Bukhari, Vol.6, Hadith No.283).","ref":null}],"tokens":[{"key":"83:34:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ","kind":"word","gloss":"So today","transliteration":"fal-yawma","lemma":"يَوْم","root":"يوم","entryId":"l-bd6f5747b4dfe79c"},{"key":"83:34:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"83:34:3","position":3,"arabic":"ءَامَنُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","root":"امن","entryId":"l-f6ec3a6dc0f76aa6"},{"key":"83:34:4","position":4,"arabic":"مِنَ","kind":"word","gloss":"at","transliteration":"mina","lemma":"مِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-9235e02e84a628b3"},{"key":"83:34:5","position":5,"arabic":"ٱلْكُفَّارِ","ki